              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Josephine Roeper"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I didn't have any hazelnuts so instead I used pecans. The only modification I did was adding 1/2 cup of apple juice to take out some of the sour cream taste. Next time I might substitute the apple cider with the apple juice."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
