              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sonia"
            },
            "reviewBody": "GAH! So tasty, and SO SIMPLE. We didn't have hazelnuts, but walnuts were just as delicious I'm sure. And the apple cider is a PERFECT complement! YUM.",
