            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Crystal Von Picklestien"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It was good, but seemed kind of bland to me. Maybe I just picked out bad potatoes? I added a little bit more cider and some brown sugar, but couldn't get it to taste just right. (to me).",
